@host = http://localhost:5080

### Santé du serveur
GET {{host}}/health

### Connexion avec le compte de démonstration (si Seed:Enabled = true)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alexandre.martin@entreprise.com", "password": "Demo1234" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Inscription
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Test Utilisateur", "email": "test@entreprise.com", "password": "Test1234" }

### Liste des documents actifs (filtres : search, category, extension, sort)
GET {{host}}/api/documents?search=rapport&category=Finance&sort=name
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Documents archivés
GET {{host}}/api/documents?archived=true&sort=archived_desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Détail d'un document (remplacer l'identifiant)
GET {{host}}/api/documents/ID_DU_DOCUMENT
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Versions d'un document
GET {{host}}/api/documents/ID_DU_DOCUMENT/versions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Corbeille : liste, mettre à la corbeille, restaurer, supprimer définitivement
GET {{host}}/api/documents?trash=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
DELETE {{host}}/api/documents/ID_DU_DOCUMENT
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{host}}/api/documents/ID_DU_DOCUMENT/undelete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
DELETE {{host}}/api/documents/ID_DU_DOCUMENT/purge
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Archiver / restaurer
POST {{host}}/api/documents/ID_DU_DOCUMENT/archive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{host}}/api/documents/ID_DU_DOCUMENT/unarchive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
